],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids shows October to November under 90% of normal in 44 of 75 years. In 2025, January to February and November to December each came in at 17% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, the middle of the grids shows February to March at 29% and March to April at 32%. Grid 16914 had its driest year in 2011 at 33% of normal.</p>"}
